---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About | Better Zamboanga City" description="About this independent, volunteer-maintained civic information portal and how to report a correction.">
  <section class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 max-w-3xl w-full space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900">About Better Zamboanga City</h1>
    <p>Better Zamboanga City is an independent, volunteer-maintained civic information portal. It brings together local directories, public records, and links to city services.</p>
    <p class="p-4 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-[4px]"><strong>This is not an official government website.</strong> It is not owned, operated, endorsed, or approved by the City Government of Zamboanga or any public agency.</p>
    <p>Information can change. Confirm service requirements, contact details, and time-sensitive records with the responsible agency before you act.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Report a correction</h2>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/BetterZamboangaCity-org/betterzamboangacity/issues" class="text-blue-700 underline">Open an issue in the project repository</a>. Include the page address, the information to correct, and a public source when available. Do not include private personal information.</p>
    <p><a href="/open-data" class="text-blue-700 underline">Read about the data</a> or <a href="/site-map" class="text-blue-700 underline">browse the site map</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
